ty Film"},{"animation":true,"id":37,"name":"Studio DEEN"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Ranma Saotome, the boy who turns into a girl with a splash of water, always has his hands full fending off crazed admirers. One of the most fanatical is Shampoo, a girl from a tribe of Chinese Amazons who tried to kill girl Ranma, was defeated by boy Ranma, and then proposes marriage to him due to her clan's rule. Things get a little crazier when Shampoo falls into a cursed spring and turns into a cat! And even crazier when Mousse, who is in love with Shampoo, challenges Ranma to a battle over... Ranma's fiancee, Akane...?\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)\n\nNote: Episodes 7-9 were originally meant to be seen between episodes 13 and 14 of the original series."},"tags":[{"name":"Arranged Marriage","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mixed Gender Harem","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cultivation","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Harem","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cohabitation","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ice Sports","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shogi","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Ranma ½ (1989)","english":"Ranma ½ (1989)","native":"らんま1/2 熱闘編","romaji":"Ranma 1/2: Nett